  "reply": "Validation errors usually mean a required field is mis‑configured. Verify that each required field has the **Mandatory** toggle on, that no fields share duplicate IDs, and that any dropdowns have options assigned. After fixing these issues, clear your browser cache and reload the Form Builder, then try publishing again. If errors persist after correcting the flagged items, please contact support."
